:: Car - Explore night [Place bg-garage]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore_car/night_drive.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
You took the car out after dark. Past the edge of the settlement the road vanished into black, and the headlights were the only thing between you and whatever was out there.
<br /><br />
With the lights on you could make time and see what you were driving into. So could anyone watching the road. With them off you would be almost invisible, crawling along by moonlight, hoping nothing was lying in the road.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Drive with the headlights on'>>
	<<run setup.night.startTrip('car', 'light', 'headlights')>>
	<<goto 'Car - Explore night roll'>>
<</link>><<link 'Kill the lights and drive dark'>>
	<<run setup.night.startTrip('car', 'dark')>>
	<<goto 'Car - Explore night roll'>>
<</link>>
